0..77 Comment "// The reduct the checker applies, written out (#2030). In the explicit form,"
78..152 Comment "// a monoid standing where a semigroup is asked is written as the reduct\'s"
153..230 Comment "// call, `Monoid.Semigroup(endoMonoid)`; the sugared form leaves that call to"
231..306 Comment "// the checker. The formatter writes the call where the checker applies the"
307..382 Comment "// reduct and keeps it here, and the run reads the same application in both"
383..392 Comment "// forms."
